www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1772391312-dragonfly-logo.png",{"link":29,"scale":45,"logo":46},1.2,{"url":47},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1772391351-multicoin-logo.png",{"link":29,"scale":19,"logo":49},{"url":50},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1781271187-parafi.png",{"title":52,"subtitle":53,"items":54},"Introducing Saffron Vaults","Earn fixed yield on Saffron by being a liquidity provider.",[55,59],{"id":56,"title":57,"text":58},"AB9S7MTMRWiTAOpkAC3c9A","Variable yield","\u003Cp>Earn increased yield from an existing LP.\u003C/p>",{"id":60,"title":61,"text":62},"JWyJXpdtQk2Ba6cYJeJx4w","Fixed yield","\u003Cp>Earn an upfront premium payment\u003Cbr>by providing liquidity to any pair.\u003C/p>",{"texts":64},{"title":65,"subtitle":66,"text":67,"links":68},"The $SFI Token","Saffron's native token is Spice (SFI).","\u003Cp dir=\"ltr\">Major protocol and treasury management decisions are made by a group of 12,000 distributed token holders who are authorized to vote in the Saffron DAO.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp dir=\"ltr\">SFI was originally minted during a liquidity mining program from October 2020 to June 2021.\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cb id=\"docs-internal-guid-c950744a-7fff-99db-859f-916bd2ba037f\">\u003C/b>\u003C/p>",[69],{"id":70,"label":71,"internal":19,"external":72},"W4Ra-iJlQkuFzjo0SOh1dw","Learn More","https://docs.saffron.finance/introduction#saffron%E2%80%99s-native-token-spice-sfi",{"texts":74},{"title":75,"subtitle":8,"text":76,"links":77},"Saffron's vaults","\u003Cp>Saffron is a DeFi native yield exchange system built on Uniswap concentrated liquidity pools. Saffron vaults are permissionless, immutable, and non-upgradable smart contracts live on all EVM chains. Uniswap fees are the first underlying yield source built into Saffron vaults.\u003C/p>",[78],{"id":79,"label":80,"internal":19,"external":81},"JzYH3tePRTSSjlgvxCwUtw","Explore Vaults","https://docs.saffron.finance/saffron-vaults/overview",{"logos":83,"texts":107,"title2":29},[84,88,91,95,98,101,104],{"link":85,"scale":19,"logo":86},"https://docs.saffron.finance/security/audits",{"url":87},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1772637571-logo-chain.png",{"link":85,"scale":19,"logo":89},{"url":90},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1772637571-logo-halborn.png",{"link":85,"scale":92,"logo":93},1.25,{"url":94},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1772637571-logo-ox.png",{"link":85,"scale":19,"logo":96},{"url":97},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1772637571-logo-quantstamp.png",{"link":85,"scale":19,"logo":99},{"url":100},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1781272482-pashov-2.png",{"link":85,"scale":19,"logo":102},{"url":103},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1781272491-sherlock-2.png",{"link":85,"scale":19,"logo":105},{"url":106},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1781272505-webthree-2.png",{"title":108,"subtitle":109,"text":110,"links":111},"Third party audits and Saffron security","Saffron's immutable smart contract system sits on top of Uniswap as a DeFi primitive enabling fixed yield. View the full history, including 9 code audits, below.","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Nunc a viverra urna, quis imperdiet nibh. Phasellus dignissim felis et nisl auctor ultrices. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Pellentesque habitant morbi tristique senectus et netus et malesuada fames ac turpis egestas.&nbsp;\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[112],{"id":113,"label":114,"internal":19,"external":85},"CsaapURBTEybIb4R-71W2Q","Audits",{"items":116},[117,120,123],{"id":118,"text":119},"aCCwXnCrRBm0_yiZZVD20Q","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>The first implementation of the Saffron risk exchange mechanism was released in October 2020 as a DeFi tranching mechanism for Compound.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"id":121,"text":122},"VjQtUGNOT6SCXS6waIorDg","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>It was later deprecated in 2021 and replaced by a DeFi insurance mechanism, where users entered short-term insurance contracts protecting against underlying protocol failure.&nbsp;\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"id":124,"text":125},"XhhuuIBdREG7Hup4kxke5Q","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>This resulted in one successful protocol cover and payout on the Harmony network.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"texts":127,"list":139},{"title":128,"subtitle":129,"text":29,"links":130},"Governed by the Saffron Community","Saffron is a fully decentralized, community governed protocol currently with 12,000 individual voting addresses.",[131,135],{"id":132,"label":133,"internal":19,"external":134},"TJa8caCQRmmsZXTW7NILVQ","Governance","https://snapshot.org/#/s:saffron-finance.eth",{"id":136,"label":137,"internal":19,"external":138},"AD5LD5XPSYmO9Q0Gi-gDxw","Forum","https://gov.finance/",[140,144,148],{"id":141,"title":142,"text":143},"OZuSDxoMQkKjk3E9kN3QCg","Non-custodial","\u003Cdiv>\n\u003Cdiv>\u003Cspan>Saffron's protocol's ensures no one can access or control depositors' funds.\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\n\u003C/div>",{"id":145,"title":146,"text":147},"UGvHzB8_ST6vEtueqnWLHw","Transparent","\u003Cdiv>\n\u003Cdiv>\u003Cspan>Key decisions require public votes by SFI token holders, ensuring accountability to both users and the wider Ethereum community.\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\n\u003C/div>",{"id":149,"title":150,"text":151},"Q0gP2ItqTVutQ4G3AktBxg","Resilient","\u003Cdiv>\n\u003Cdiv>\u003Cspan>Saffron ecosystem participants are always pushing to make the protocol more decentralized in pursuit of greater resilience.\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\n\u003C/div>",{"title":153,"subtitle":154},"Saffron Media","Start your journey into Saffron Finance by viewing our articles, tutorials, and updates.",{"title":156,"link":157,"items":164},"Frequently\nasked\nquestions",{"id":158,"label":159,"internal":160,"external":29},"NqFwGja3QtGWWK6FmzH2_g","View All",{"id":161,"type":162,"title":163},"GjtTyVzNQhePUmjxRkss-Q","faq_index","FAQ",[165,169,173,176],{"id":166,"question":167,"answer":168},"Zsh_vz6vR_WjF4bNKhwF5A","What is the SFI token used for?","\u003Cdiv>\n\u003Cdiv>\u003Cspan>SFI is the governance token of the Saffron protocol. Holders can vote on protocol upgrades, parameter changes, and new pool additions. SFI is bought back on the market using protocol revenue earned by the vault system.\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\n\u003C/div>",{"id":170,"question":171,"answer":172},"WCk-4ndeTs6SXw9mHlseUw","What risks should I be aware of when using Saffron Finance?","\u003Cdiv>\n\u003Cdiv>\u003Cspan>As with all DeFi protocols, risks include smart contract vulnerabilities, underlying platform risk, and liquidity risk. Saffron mitigates these through multiple third-party audits, bug bounties, and active monitoring by Hypernative. Users can buy additional deposit coverage on Nexus Mutual.\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\n\u003C/div>",{"id":174,"question":175,"answer":76},"fScSPOUpQ6iluzvorbugGg","What is Saffron Finance and how does it work?",{"id":177,"question":178,"answer":179},"LXDjU2BsRWm74EaScIVWcQ","How do I get started using Saffron Finance?","\u003Cdiv>\n\u003Cdiv>\u003Cspan>Connect your wallet at app.saffron.finance, browse available vaults, and deposit into a vault that matches your risk preference. Alternatively, create a vault using the Create Vault page.&nbsp;\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\n\u003C/div>",{"texts":181,"items":189},{"title":182,"subtitle":183,"text":29,"links":184},"Become an expert with Saffron","Dive into Saffron Finance through our Essentials, DeFi Basics, Newsletters, and Podcasts all in one place on Saffron Media.",[185],{"id":186,"label":187,"internal":188,"external":16},"FhfKnD8kRJWR0CbWmE9uqA","Launch App",{"id":13,"type":14,"title":15},[190,200,211],{"id":191,"title":192,"text":193,"link":194},"VgC62lK7SGGZVBDRO5aw3w","Listen to Podcast","Hear from industry leaders, builders, and investors driving the future of finance.",{"id":195,"label":71,"internal":196,"external":29},"C8qJ9ahxTDegIAs7CBjcEg",{"id":197,"type":198,"title":199},"Iy0MEGeTSSecahRuScDSJQ","academy_index","Media",{"id":201,"title":202,"text":203,"link":204},"HlAJGOsnTjKiTERrdeubuQ","Saffron Brand","Here's everything you need to represent Saffron accurately. Download our logos, color palette, and core brand assets.",{"id":205,"label":206,"internal":207,"external":29},"QfE36TGNQ_uqHm0fCaKzLQ","View Brand Assets",{"id":208,"type":209,"title":210},"JHStYRSnS5KZDNTfKwyjAQ","brand","Brand",{"id":212,"title":213,"text":214,"link":215},"SUWpmkJPRQemQAU-9im_Cg","Documentation","Start your journey into Saffron Finance by viewing our most recent documentation.",{"id":216,"label":71,"internal":19,"external":217},"UNzHFlW6TBieHkQt-gMvFw","https://docs.saffron.finance/introduction",{"page":219,"posts":221,"_allAcademiesMeta":352},{"hero":220,"seo":19},{"title":153,"subtitle":154},[222,233,244,255,266,277,299,321,331],{"published":223,"id":224,"date":225,"slug":226,"title":227,"excerpt":228,"podcast":229,"thumbnail":19,"cat":19},"2026-06-17T20:41:23.668+01:00","LP6CYe4ASdWpKo4n7mR89Q","2026-05-07","the-bill-that-might-actually-move","The Bill That Might Actually Move","Hosts Justin and Dingo discuss the CLARITY Act, the US government's major effort to define how crypto - especially stablecoins - fits into the traditional financial system.",{"file":230,"episode":232},{"url":231},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1781725262-saffron-files-5-7-26.mp3",9,{"published":234,"id":235,"date":236,"slug":237,"title":238,"excerpt":239,"podcast":240,"thumbnail":19,"cat":19},"2026-06-08T13:54:29.579+01:00","bucSoFWPSkeqS2EBoMdDoA","2026-04-21","trust-isnt-given-its-earned","Trust Isn't Given. It's Earned.","In this episode of Saffron Files, Justin Roberti and Dingo discuss the fallout from the Kelp DAO exploit, the importance of rebuilding trust through stronger security, and explore the risks and possibilities of AI-powered programmable money.",{"file":241,"episode":243},{"url":242},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1780923061-saffron-files-4-21-26_episode_7.mp3",8,{"published":245,"id":246,"date":247,"slug":248,"title":249,"excerpt":250,"podcast":251,"thumbnail":19,"cat":19},"2026-06-08T13:54:09.456+01:00","SCOc9fstQ-e5Z_XDR8Ruzw","2026-04-11","never-blindly-sign-even-from-friends","Never Blindly Sign, Even From Friends","Justin Roberti and Dingo break down the Drift Protocol exploit and how social engineering, not just code, keeps taking DeFi down. They also cover Dingo's takeaways from EthCC, from institutional adoption to the tension between permissioned finance and DeFi's roots.",{"file":252,"episode":254},{"url":253},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1780923063-saffron-files-4-11-26_episode_6.mp3",7,{"published":256,"id":257,"date":258,"slug":259,"title":260,"excerpt":261,"podcast":262,"thumbnail":19,"cat":19},"2026-07-16T19:37:36.423+01:00","JLSgifPvS--3r6G6HRvOpw","2026-03-30","is-bitcoin-even-a-hedge-anymore","Is Bitcoin Even a Hedge Anymore?","In this episode of Saffron Files, Justin Roberti and Dingo discuss Bitcoin’s response to macroeconomic uncertainty, the stalled Clarity Act, stablecoin yield, tokenized financial infrastructure and the risk of TradFi absorbing DeFi on unfavorable terms.",{"file":263,"episode":265},{"url":264},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1784226943-saffron-files-3-30-26.wav",6,{"published":267,"id":268,"date":269,"slug":270,"title":271,"excerpt":272,"podcast":273,"thumbnail":19,"cat":19},"2026-06-08T13:53:54.706+01:00","FjoPoB5DQq2oqfwbNmYpiw","2026-03-22","is-private-credit-cooked"," Is Private Credit Cooked?","Justin Roberti and Dingo dig into the SEC's tokenized-stock approval, mounting stress in private credit, and what it all means for decentralization. They also cover AI's impact on software lending and give an update on Saffron's ongoing vault testing.",{"file":274,"episode":276},{"url":275},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1780923063-saffron-files-3-22-26_episode_5.mp3",5,{"published":278,"id":279,"date":280,"slug":281,"title":282,"excerpt":283,"podcast":19,"thumbnail":284,"cat":19},"2026-05-13T23:29:06.235+01:00","AZoQg8JLRXKPxebL_e0C5g","2026-03-16","the-day-crypto-entered-the-federal-reserve","The Day Crypto Entered the Federal Reserve","Dingo breaks down Kraken Financial becoming the first crypto institution to receive a Federal Reserve master account, and what direct access to the Fed's payment rails actually means. He unpacks why this is more significant than the hype suggests, and what it signals for the future boundary between TradFi and crypto.",{"id":285,"alt":19,"title":19,"focalPoint":286,"width":287,"height":288,"thumbnail":289,"small":290,"medium":291,"responsiveImage":292,"video":19},"T2YzfwtjShS4MbNU07qgXg",{"x":21,"y":21},1252,500,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778615782-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-3-56-10-pm.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=600&q=85&w=600","https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778615782-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-3-56-10-pm.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=1000&q=85&w=1000","https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778615782-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-3-56-10-pm.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=1500&q=85&w=1500",{"srcSet":293,"webpSrcSet":29,"sizes":294,"src":295,"width":287,"height":288,"aspectRatio":296,"alt":19,"title":19,"base64":297,"bgColor":298},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778615782-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-3-56-10-pm.png?auto=format&dpr=0.25&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 313w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778615782-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-3-56-10-pm.png?auto=format&dpr=0.5&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 626w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778615782-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-3-56-10-pm.png?auto=format&dpr=0.75&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 939w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778615782-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-3-56-10-pm.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 1252w","(max-width: 1252px) 100vw, 1252px","https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778615782-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-3-56-10-pm.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440",2.504,"data:image/jpeg;base64,","#6e59c5",{"published":300,"id":301,"date":302,"slug":303,"title":304,"excerpt":305,"podcast":19,"thumbnail":306,"cat":19},"2026-05-17T15:29:54.335+01:00","C4TkTeV8RGOmVPJ4nF4ycA","2026-03-06","the-japanese-yen-carry-trade","The Japanese Yen Carry Trade","Tupelo breaks down the Japanese yen carry trade, nearly 30 years of cheap borrowed yen that's propped up global asset prices, and what happens now that it's unwinding. He examines why the sell-off could pressure equities, real estate and crypto alike, and what a Treasury response might mean for a softer landing.",{"id":307,"alt":19,"title":19,"focalPoint":308,"width":309,"height":310,"thumbnail":311,"small":312,"medium":313,"responsiveImage":314,"video":19},"esJf1tAZRKO0PvQxiPZ6kQ",{"x":21,"y":21},1250,498,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778616048-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-3-59-38-pm.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=600&q=85&w=600","https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778616048-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-3-59-38-pm.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=1000&q=85&w=1000","https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778616048-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-3-59-38-pm.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=1500&q=85&w=1500",{"srcSet":315,"webpSrcSet":29,"sizes":316,"src":317,"width":309,"height":310,"aspectRatio":318,"alt":19,"title":19,"base64":319,"bgColor":320},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778616048-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-3-59-38-pm.png?auto=format&dpr=0.25&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 312w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778616048-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-3-59-38-pm.png?auto=format&dpr=0.5&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 625w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778616048-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-3-59-38-pm.png?auto=format&dpr=0.75&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 937w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778616048-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-3-59-38-pm.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 1250w","(max-width: 1250px) 100vw, 1250px","https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778616048-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-3-59-38-pm.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440",2.5100401606425704,"data:image/jpeg;base64,","#c63835",{"published":322,"id":323,"date":302,"slug":324,"title":325,"excerpt":326,"podcast":327,"thumbnail":19,"cat":19},"2026-06-08T13:53:40.127+01:00","aanfY847SdCYlqQOe0BdIA","the-trillion-dollar-trade-youve-never-heard-of","The Trillion-Dollar Trade You've Never Heard Of","Justin Roberti, Dingo and Tupelo dig into how the unwinding Japanese yen carry trade could pressure stocks, real estate, crypto and other risk assets. They also cover Kraken Financial's direct access to the Federal Reserve's payment system and what it signals for crypto's integration with TradFi.",{"file":328,"episode":330},{"url":329},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1780923064-saffron-files-3-6-26_episode_4.mp3",4,{"published":332,"id":333,"date":334,"slug":335,"title":336,"excerpt":337,"podcast":19,"thumbnail":338,"cat":19},"2026-05-17T15:29:47.516+01:00","Uv_Ms1EsRF-hbKR8nZTlcA","2026-02-27","why-range-matters-in-uniswap-v3-same-assets-different-outcomes","Why Range Matters in Uniswap v3: Same Assets, Different Outcomes ","Dingo breaks down why range matters in Uniswap v3, using a farmers-market analogy to explain how liquidity concentration shapes returns. He also connects it back to Saffron Vaults, showing how fixed and variable participants can customize their exposure on top of the same underlying position.",{"id":339,"alt":19,"title":19,"focalPoint":340,"width":341,"height":288,"thumbnail":342,"small":343,"medium":344,"responsiveImage":345,"video":19},"YzYPgvluTpa92852pBPFfA",{"x":21,"y":21},1248,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778616206-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-4-03-18-pm.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=600&q=85&w=600","https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778616206-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-4-03-18-pm.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=1000&q=85&w=1000","https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778616206-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-4-03-18-pm.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=1500&q=85&w=1500",{"srcSet":346,"webpSrcSet":29,"sizes":347,"src":348,"width":341,"height":288,"aspectRatio":349,"alt":19,"title":19,"base64":350,"bgColor":351},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778616206-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-4-03-18-pm.png?auto=format&dpr=0.25&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 312w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778616206-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-4-03-18-pm.png?auto=format&dpr=0.5&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 624w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778616206-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-4-03-18-pm.png?auto=format&dpr=0.75&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 936w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778616206-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-4-03-18-pm.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440 1248w","(max-width: 1248px) 100vw, 1248px","https://www.datocms-assets.com/195831/1778616206-screenshot-2026-05-12-at-4-03-18-pm.png?auto=format&fit=max&h=2440&q=85&w=2440",2.496,"data:image/jpeg;base64,","#1e92fa",{"count":353},13,1788620512393]